{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bfd6692-db0e-11ef-8572-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bfd6682-db0e-11ef-812d-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":1,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":5,"chapter_name":"避讳篇第五","chenzhu_chapter":"避讳为民国以前吾国特有之体制，故史书上之记载，有待于以避讳解释者甚众，不讲避讳学，不足以读中国之史也，吾昔撰《史讳举例》问世，职为是焉。胡身之生避讳最盛之朝，熟谙避讳掌故。其撰《通鉴释文辨误後序》，谓：“海陵所刊公休《释文》，以乌桓为乌元。宋朝钦宗讳桓，靖康之初，公休没久矣，安得预为钦宗讳！”即利用避讳以证史书伪讬之一法。其注《通鉴》，以避讳为训释者尤多。兹所采不过数十条，而避讳常识已略具于是矣。","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":1,"chenzhu_text":"此避讳改前人名。然宋真庙讳恒，仁庙讳祯，此以避讳为解释在第一卷而即误者。《鉴注自序》所谓“人苦不自觉，前注之失吾知之，吾注之失吾不能知也”。陈景雲、赵绍祖辈著书专纠《胡注》，对此亦无所举正，何耶！","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":4,"tongjian_id":"CH05-CZ001"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"田氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"田氏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6684-db0e-11ef-864a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田常","people_name_jianti_auto":"田常","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6685-db0e-11ef-a068-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳成子恆","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈成子恒","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6686-db0e-11ef-bb13-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"溫公","people_name_jianti_auto":"温公","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6687-db0e-11ef-afdf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"公子完","people_name_jianti_auto":"公子完","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6688-db0e-11ef-86e2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6689-db0e-11ef-87ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陳","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8bfd668a-db0e-11ef-be1f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8bfd668b-db0e-11ef-8730-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此序齊田氏之世也。田常，卽左傳陳成子恆也。溫公避仁廟諱，改「恆」曰「常」。自陳公子完奔齊，五世至常得政。諡法：勝敵志強曰莊。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此序齐田氏之世也。田常，即左传陈成子恒也。温公避仁庙讳，改「恒」曰「常」。自陈公子完奔齐，五世至常得政。谥法：胜敌志强曰庄。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6683-db0e-11ef-92cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-411,"link_td_description":"田庄子，名田白，父为田襄子田盘，陈完之九世孙，子为田悼子。在他的努力下，田氏控制了齐国的实权。","link_td_id":"Q10008996","link_td_number_id":489231,"people_name":"莊子白","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄子白","people_xingming":"田白","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6691-db0e-11ef-9c20-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-411,"link_td_description":"田庄子，名田白，父为田襄子田盘，陈完之九世孙，子为田悼子。在他的努力下，田氏控制了齐国的实权。","link_td_id":"Q10008996","link_td_number_id":489231,"people_name":"白","people_name_jianti_auto":"白","people_xingming":"田白","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6692-db0e-11ef-8572-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2初，田常生襄子盤，盤生莊子白，白生太公和。是歲，齊田和遷齊康公於海上，使食一城，以奉其先祀。","content_fanyi":"起初，田常生襄子田盘，田盘生庄子田白，田白生太公田和。这一年，齐国田和把齐康公迁到海上，给他一座城作食邑，让他以此供奉姜氏先人的祭祀。","content_jianti_auto":"2初，田常生襄子盘，盘生庄子白，白生太公和。是岁，齐田和迁齐康公于海上，使食一城，以奉其先祀。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":50,"number":2,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一 (周紀一) / 安王 / 十一年 / 第 2 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8bfd6682-db0e-11ef-812d-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-391},"tongjian_id":"8bfd6682-db0e-11ef-812d-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":1},"profile":{"alias_list":["田白"],"biography":"田庄子，名田白，父为田襄子田盘，陈完之九世孙，子为田悼子。在他的努力下，田氏控制了齐国的实权。","death_year":-411,"link_td_id":"Q10008996","name":"田庄子","number_id":489231},"relationships":[{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_d